   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Total a) length (km) of irrigation channels constructed or rehabilitated and b) area (ha) irrigated by project interventions (CPRF 312)</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Total length (km) of irrigation channels constructed = total length of all SSIS (Small Scale Irrigation Structures).  These include but are not limited to: irrigation lines, canal / kariz cleaning, reservoirs, check-dams (diversion canals, water intakes with flow control gates to regulate water levels), drainage, canal linings, culverts, protection walls, water dividers, super passages, siphons, and aqueducts, constructed/completed.</narrative>
    </description>
